    "description": {
      "value": "\n<p><em>“Water remembers feeling. So do you.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Memory Tide (1/Soma Break).</strong> You flood a creature you can see within 6 squares with recall. Choose one: calm (ends hostility briefly), charm, or stun for 1 round (GM may require a save depending on target).</p>\n        <p><strong>Depth-Sight.</strong> You can see normally in darkness and underwater (your eyes read pressure and motion).</p><p><strong>Tide-sight.</strong> You have darkvision out to 12 squares.</p>",
